<title>FINLAND: Kemira 1996 profit by division.</title>
<headline>Kemira 1996 profit by division.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish chemicals group Kemira Oy on Monday gave the following breakdown by division of its 1996 results (million markka).</p>
<p>    OPERATING PROFIT	 1996		  1995</p>
<p> Kemira Chemicals	     421		   379</p>
<p> Kemira Pigments		-21		   255</p>
<p> Kemira Agro		    746		   655</p>
<p> Tikkurila			222		   144</p>
<p> Other 1)			-120		   -96</p>
<p> TOTAL			  1,248		 1,337</p>
<p>NET SALES</p>
<p> Kemira Chemicals	   3,090		 2,809</p>
<p> Kemira Pigments	    2,108		 2,279</p>
<p> Kemira Agro		  6,278		 6,123</p>
<p> Tikkurila		    1,517		 1,408</p>
<p> Other 1)		     1,107		 1,258</p>
<p> Intra-group sales	   -629		  -593</p>
<p> TOTAL			 13,471		13,284</p>
<p>1) Includes other businesses, group administration and eliminations from operating income.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
